          "Best personality model for prediction?",
          "Big Five (OCEAN) — factor-analytically derived, replicated"
        ],
        [
          "Most predictive single trait for job performance?",
          "Conscientiousness (r~0.24)"
        ],
        [
          "Predicts mental health best (negatively)?",
          "Neuroticism"
        ],
        [
          "Does personality change?",
          "Yes, slowly — mean-level maturation; possible through deliberate effort"
        ],
        [
          "Should I use MBTI for hiring?",
          "No — poor reliability, weak validity"
        ],
        [
          "What is the Dark Triad?",
          "Narcissism + Machiavellianism + Psychopathy; distinct but correlated"
        ],
